Lesson 2: Comparison Operators
মনে রাখবে:
 = দিয়ে variable-এ value assign করা হয়।
 == দিয়ে দুটি value সমান কি না পরীক্ষা করা হয়।
fungi_images = 50

print (fungi_images > 0) # true
print (fungi_images == 50) # true
print (fungi_images < 10) # false
Lesson 3: if, elif, এবং else
image_count = 50

if image_count > 100 :
    print ("Large dataset")
elif image_count > 0 :
    print ("Small dataset")
else:
    print ("No images avialable")
    
Lesson 4: Negative input validation
fungi_images = int (input("Enter fungal image count :"))
bacteria_images = int (input ("Enter bacterial image count :"))

if fungi_images < 0 or bacteria_images < 0 :
    print ("Error: image counts cannot be negative")

else :
    valid_images = fungi_images + bacteria_images 

    print ("Valid images :",valid_images)

    if valid_images > 0 :
        fungal_percentage = (fungi_images / valid_images) * 100
        bacterial_percentage = (bacteria_images / valid_images) * 100

        print ("Fungal Percentage :",round(fungi_images,2),"%")
        print ("Bacterial Percentage :",round(bacteria_images,2),"%")
    else :
        print ("No valid images available.")
